ty end markets under MOSAIC brand. In addition, the company offers identification friend; monopulse secondary surveillance radars, and air traffic control systems; wired and wireless communication systems; designs, produces, and tests specialized multi-chip RF modules and components; and manufactures off-the-shelf surface mount microwave components. Further, it provides thick-film ceramic substrates, custom designed application specific integrated circuits, and conventional PCBs; custom electronic assemblies; QTA services; and thermal management. The company serves original equipment manufacturers, electronic manufacturing services providers, original design manufacturers, distributors, and government agencies; and aerospace and defense, data center computing, automotive, medical, industrial, instrumentation, and networking markets. TTM Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Santa Ana, California.","employees":18200,"website":"https://www.ttm.com","country":"United States","city":"Santa Ana","officers":[{"name":"Dr. Edwin  Roks B.Sc., M.Sc., Ph.D.","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Daniel L. Boehle CPA","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Daniel J. Weber","title":"Executive VP, Chief Legal Officer, General Counsel & Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.47,"tpe":29.99,"ps":4.426,"pfcf":26.06,"peg":1.11,"pb":4.665,"ev_ebitda":19.01,"rev_growth":0.191,"eps_growth":0.356,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2432,"eps_growth_next":0.1809,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1241,"roa":0.04945,"de":32.8,"gross_margin":0.5312,"op_margin":0.1174,"profit_margin":0.09364,"current_ratio":1.863},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":17.47,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":30.51,"sector":29.99,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.1,"sector":4.426,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":294.1,"sector":26.06,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.36,"